{
  "bodyHash": "d6d37231c52b7dff",
  "content": "Привет мир<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Bundle. Made with love. Serilum's mods combined, for easier downloading!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the bundle\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Extra Bundle</strong> 是一种特殊类型的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>extra-type</strong> 模组整合到一个文件中。虽然我将自己的模组分组非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让安装变得更加容易。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系统。这意味着包含的模组保持完全独立，同时允许像整合包一样以捆绑方式安装它们。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们。<br><br>该整合包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但并未取代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用包含的模组。<strong>更改生效需要重启游戏。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作原理，无论您是正常安装该模组，还是同时安装该模组以及整合包中包含的模组，它都能兼容。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，但如果不小心通过这种方式重复安装了模组，也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是问题，但当然最好只安装一次。因此，如果您决定安装此整合包，可以移除任何已安装的属于此整合包的模组。<br><br>我希望这个整合包对喜欢大型内容模组的您有所帮助。非常感谢这些年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"Environment: Client &amp; Server\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary><span><strong>enableAllLootDrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableAprilFools</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBiggerSpongeAbsorptionRadius</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBouncierBeds</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCryingGhasts</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCryingPortals</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableDeathBackup</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEasyElevators</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEdibles</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableExtractPoison</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFallThroughSlime</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFasterCrouching</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFixedAnvilRepairCost</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGrassSeeds</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHandOverYourItems</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableInfiniteTrading</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMilkAllTheMobs</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNameTagTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePaperBooks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePassiveEndermen</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePlaceableBlazeRods</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomBoneMealFlowers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomSheepColours</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomShulkerColours</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableShulkerDropsTwo</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTNTBreaksBedrock</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTranscendingTrident</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVillagerDeathMessages</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Available Bundles\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下是可用的 Serilum 模组整合包：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Client Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Customization Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Extra Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's QoL Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's RPG Bundle</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum's Spawn Bundle</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Mods included\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/all-loot-drops.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\">All Loot Drops</a></td>\n<td>生物在死亡时会掉落所有可能的战利品，数量可配置，支持掠夺附魔。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/april-fools.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\">April Fools</a></td>\n<td>在愚人节启用各种愚蠢且有趣的可配置功能！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\">Bigger Sponge Absorption Radius</a></td>\n<td>每个额外放置的海绵块会增加水的吸收半径。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bouncier-beds.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\">Bouncier Beds</a></td>\n<td>使玩家在床上弹得更高，并防止在床上摔落伤害。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-ghasts.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\">Crying Ghasts</a></td>\n<td>当玩家靠近时，恶魂会定期掉落眼泪，从而实现可持续 farming。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-portals.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\">Crying Portals</a></td>\n<td>允许使用哭泣的黑曜石方块建造下界传送门。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/death-backup.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\">Death Backup</a></td>\n<td>在玩家死亡前创建物品栏备份，可以通过命令加载。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elevators.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\">Easy Elevators</a></td>\n<td>通过多方块电梯轻松上下！高度可配置，利用现有资源。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/edibles.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/edibles\" target=\"_blank\">Edibles</a></td>\n<td>使许多食材变得可食用，食用后玩家会获得短暂的状态效果。允许食用烈焰粉、萤石粉、岩浆膏、糖、恶魂之泪、幻翼膜和兔脚。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extract-poison.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\">Extract Poison</a></td>\n<td>用空玻璃瓶从洞穴蜘蛛、河豚和蜜蜂身上提取毒药。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fall-through-slime.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\">Fall Through Slime</a></td>\n<td> slime 方块在静止时不再支撑你的重量，你会慢慢穿过它。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/faster-crouching.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\">Faster Crouching</a></td>\n<td>蹲下/潜行时也能以正常速度冲刺和行走。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fixed-anvil-repair-cost.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\">Fixed Anvil Repair Cost</a></td>\n<td>修复铁砧，设置默认的等级消耗、材料消耗和修复百分比。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grass-seeds.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\">Grass Seeds</a></td>\n<td>允许玩家使用普通种子将泥土转化为（高）草丛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hand-over-your-items.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\">Hand Over Your Items</a></td>\n<td>增加游戏内玩家之间直接传递物品堆的功能，无需丢弃或投掷。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/infinite-trading.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\">Infinite Trading</a></td>\n<td>防止村民交易锁定，使其始终可用。尽情交易吧！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/milk-all-the-mobs.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\">Milk All The Mobs</a></td>\n<td>允许绵羊、羊驼、猪、驴、马和骡子生产牛奶桶。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/name-tag-tweaks.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">Name Tag Tweaks</a></td>\n<td>添加命名牌合成配方、命令，且带有名称的生物死亡时会掉落命名牌。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/paper-books.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\">Paper Books</a></td>\n<td>允许使用 9 张纸制作书。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-endermen.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\">Passive Endermen</a></td>\n<td>防止末影人在被注视时传送、放置/拾取方块（破坏）和攻击。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/placeable-blaze-rods.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\">Placeable Blaze Rods</a></td>\n<td>使烈焰棒可以作为自定义方块放置在世界中，类似于末地烛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-bone-meal-flowers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\">Random Bone Meal Flowers</a></td>\n<td>随机化骨粉生成的花朵，允许所有（模组添加的）类型在任何地方生成。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-sheep-colours.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\">Random Sheep Colours</a></td>\n<td>新生成的绵羊会根据可配置列表随机生成羊毛颜色。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-shulker-colours.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\">Random Shulker Colours</a></td>\n<td>新生成的潜影贝会根据可配置列表随机生成外壳颜色。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/shulker-drops-two.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\">Shulker Drops Two</a></td>\n<td>允许潜影贝掉落两个或更多贝壳，并忽略其默认掉落几率。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tnt-breaks-bedrock.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\">TNT Breaks Bedrock</a></td>\n<td>允许 TNT 炸毁基岩，轻松进入下界屋顶！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/transcending-trident.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\">Transcending Trident</a></td>\n<td>增强三叉戟。手持水桶可以在任何地方使用更强大的激流附魔。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/villager-death-messages.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\">Villager Death Messages</a></td>\n<td>每当村民死亡时广播一条信息性死亡消息。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何模组包中使用此整合包，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事项，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
